cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "npm packages that ship their own copy of PDF.js"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Gopalakrishnan
    given-names: Aneesh
date-released: 2026-10-30
version: "1.0.0"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/codehippie1/npm-pdfjs-copies"
abstract: >-
  npm packages that carry a copy of Mozilla PDF.js inside their published files, which PDF.js
  release every package release carries, and how far behind upstream those copies were on the day
  each release was published. Collected 30 October 2026 from public npm registry and jsDelivr data.
keywords:
  - npm
  - PDF.js
  - vendored dependencies
  - copy-based reuse
  - technical lag
  - CVE-2024-4367
